MFLOW 2
NAME Hydraulic: power unit & 4/3
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 P1 pumps oil at up to 120 bar, RV1 relieves\nabove 100. In the centre of V1 the pump\nunloads to tank; 1 lifts, 2 lowers.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Click V1 three times: centre, up, down.\nSet RV1 lower (wheel): the gauge follows.

PAGE Plant
LAYERS 4 1
LAYER 1 1 0 Process
LAYER 2 1 0 Notes
LAYER 3 1 0 Equipment
LAYER 4 1 0 Hydraulic
GRAVITY 1.00
ON 1
ON 2
LABEL 24.00 90.00 HYDRAULIC LIFT\nClick V1 to step it: 0 centre (the pump\nunloads to tank), 1 up, 2 down.\nRV1 limits the pressure to 100 bar.
